      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dril...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400720069006C002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh, chic<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa MZ. ¡Veo que has dado con el canalla\nque ha arruinado nuestro jardín!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era este Pokémon",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007200610020006500730074006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era un Drilbur",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450072006100200075006E0020004400720069006C0062007500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tú, piltrafilla! ¡Quien mancilla la sede del clan\nse merece un buen escarmiento!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTe vas a venir conmigo a arreglar el destrozo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ven tú también, chic<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa MZ.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006E0020007400FA002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002C0020006300680069006300100003110000FF0101006F00610020004D005A002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bur...",
